    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992-sec-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3 Section 3",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992#sec-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992.pdf, p.2",
      "values:originalText": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting the\nfollowing definition:\n\" 'international agricultural research centre' means an independent,\nnon-profit organisation that:\n(a) is internationally funded; and\n(b) carries out:\n(i) research\ninto\nsustainable\nimprovements\nin\nthe\nproductivity of agriculture, forestry and fisheries in\ndeveloping countries; and\n(ii) activities related to such research;\".\nFunctions",
      "skos:definition": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting the\nfollowing definition:\n\" 'international agricultural research centre' means an independent,\nnon-profit organisation that:\n(a) is internationally funded; and\n(b) carries out:\n(i) research\ninto\nsustainable\nimprovements\nin\nthe\nproductivity of agriculture, forestry and fisheries in\ndeveloping countries; and\n(ii) activities related to such research;\".\nFunctions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992-sec-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992-sec-3-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992-sec-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f48f8490fe75539a257c3ca7664aa23a7ec969b2a0cdfe642c7af4317f3376c9",
      "skos:note": "Inserts definition for 'international agricultural research centre'."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992#sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Section 3",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 2,
      "values:originalText": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting the\nfollowing definition:\n\" 'international agricultural research centre' means an independent,\nnon-profit organisation that:\n(a) is internationally funded; and\n(b) carries out:\n(i) research\ninto\nsustainable\nimprovements\nin\nthe\nproductivity of agriculture, forestry and fisheries in\ndeveloping countries; and\n(ii) activities related to such research;\".\nFunctions"
    },
