      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992.pdf, p.2",
      "values:originalText": "Section 5 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (l)(b) \"in Australia\" (first occurring);\n(b) by adding at the end of subsection (1) the following word and\nparagraphs:\n\"; and (d) to establish and fund training schemes related to its\nresearch programs; and\n(e) to conduct and fund development activities related\nto its research programs; and\n(0 to fund international agricultural research centres.\".\nConstitution of Board",
      "skos:definition": "Section 5 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (l)(b) \"in Australia\" (first occurring);\n(b) by adding at the end of subsection (1) the following word and\nparagraphs:\n\"; and (d) to establish and fund training schemes related to its\nresearch programs; and\n(e) to conduct and fund development activities related\nto its research programs; and\n(0 to fund international agricultural research centres.\".\nConstitution of Board",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992-sec-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992-sec-4-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b3e84908beba4ec5f9bcc5b4e4bd8ad214ccffb81603afdc1c5c7c4cd0190aba",
      "skos:note": "Amend Section 5 of the Principal Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-1992#sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Section 4",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 2,
      "values:originalText": "Section 5 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (l)(b) \"in Australia\" (first occurring);\n(b) by adding at the end of subsection (1) the following word and\nparagraphs:\n\"; and (d) to establish and fund training schemes related to its\nresearch programs; and\n(e) to conduct and fund development activities related\nto its research programs; and\n(0 to fund international agricultural research centres.\".\nConstitution of Board"
    },
