      "values:originalText": "Section 19 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (l)(c) \"Director, Australian\nDevelopment Assistance Bureau\" and substituting \"DirectorGeneral, Australian International Development\nAssistance\nBureau, or a person nominated by the Director-General\";\n(b) by omitting from paragraph (l)(d) \"12 nor more than 16\" and\nsubstituting \"9 nor more than 11\";\n(c) by omitting from paragraph (3)(b) \"minority\" and substituting\n\"number\";\n(d) by omitting from paragraph (5)(c) \"12\" and substituting \"9\".\nMeetings of Council",
