      "values:originalText": "inserted:\nCentre not a Department\n\"38AA. Despite section 48Q of the Audit Act 1901, the Centre is\nnot a Department for the purposes of section 50 of that Act.\".\nDelegation by Minister\nHi Section 41 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting in\nsubsection (1) \"the Board or\" after \"delegate to\".\nRepeal of sections 43 and 44",
      "skos:definition": "inserted:\nCentre not a Department\n\"38AA. Despite section 48Q of the Audit Act 1901, the Centre is\nnot a Department for the purposes of section 50 of that Act.\".\nDelegation by Minister\nHi Section 41 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting in\nsubsection (1) \"the Board or\" after \"delegate to\".\nRepeal of sections 43 and 44",
      "cml:asserts": [
